Big lessons learned here:
-Be careful with traps
-Hide your wishing wand or stash it somewhere
-Have a backup handy(for everything)
-Throwing Mojo after being blind is a *BAD* idea
-Using Mojo while floating may not be the best idea
-wands of fire are not useless as I once thought.  Saved my life from
being slimed.
-There is a reason I normally genocide liches and vampires.  I was
very thankful I had Excalibur and used it appropriately
-Wands of secret door detection are very useful in the right
situations, like the sanctum.

Previous lessons that I utilized from the last few games.
-Engrave the E-word when eating dangerous things, or doing dangerous
activities in general
-Lock trolls in chests :)
-Scrolls of remove curse are a lot easier and more efficient when all
of your stuff is cursed.  Not sure how I have gotten so far without
that tidbit...



